"GEORGIA INVESTMENT SHOCK ANALYSIS - DEMAND SIDE FRAMEWORK"

"PROJECT OVERVIEW"
"This workbook estimates the macroeconomic impact of a 6.5 billion USD investment spending shock"
"to Georgia over an 8-year period (2026-2033) using the macro accounting framework (demand side)."

"SHEET DESCRIPTIONS"
"WEO_Data: IMF World Economic Outlook data for Georgia (2015-2043)"
"  - Historical data: 2015-2025"
"  - Projections: 2026-2043 with constant 4% growth rate from 2027"
"  - Deflator growth anchored to 4-year average (2021-2024)"

"SUPPLY & USE sheets: Supply and Use Tables from geostat (38x38)"
"  - SUPPLY: Domestic production, imports, and margins"
"  - USE: Intermediate use, final consumption, exports"

"SUT_Calc: Supply and Use Table calculations"
"  - Links to SUPPLY and USE sheets"
"  - Calculates total supply and import content share"
"  - Cell H46: Overall import content share (linked to NA sheet)"

"NA: National Accounts - Three demand-side scenarios"
"  - Scenario 1: Base case (Demand Multiplier = 0.8, Import Content = from SUT)"
"  - Scenario 2: Higher Multiplier (Demand Multiplier = 1.0, Import Content = from SUT)"
"  - Scenario 3: High Import Content (Demand Multiplier = 0.8, Import Content = 0.5)"

"KEY ASSUMPTIONS"
"Exchange Rate: 2.746 Lari/USD"
"Investment Period: 2026-2033 (8 years)"
"Investment Allocation: Bell-shaped distribution"
"Investment Deflator: GDP Deflator from WEO_Data"

"INVESTMENT ALLOCATION (Bell-shaped)"
"2026: 5% (325M USD)"
"2027: 10% (650M USD)"
"2028: 15% (975M USD)"
"2029: 20% (1,300M USD)"
"2030: 20% (1,300M USD)"
"2031: 15% (975M USD)"
"2032: 10% (650M USD)"
"2033: 5% (325M USD)"
"Total: 6,500M USD (6.5 Billion)"

"FORMULAS AND CALCULATIONS"
"✓ All calculations use Excel formulas (no hardcoded values in calculated cells)"
"✓ GDP projections: Constant 4% growth rate from 2027 onwards"
"✓ Deflator projections: Using 4-year average growth rate as anchor"
"✓ Investment in Lari: Investment (USD) × Exchange Rate"
"✓ Import Content: Investment (Lari) × Import Content Share"
"✓ Domestic Demand: Investment (Lari) - Import Content"
"✓ GDP Impact: Domestic Demand × Demand Multiplier"
"✓ GDP Growth Impact: (GDP Impact / Nominal GDP) × 100"

"DATA COLLECTION NOTES"
"WEO Data: Populate from IMF World Economic Outlook database for Georgia"
"SUPPLY & USE Tables: Download from geostat.ge (38-38 product classification)"
"  - Copy both SUPPLY and USE sheets with original sheet names"
"  - Data will automatically link to SUT_Calc sheet"
